<title>POLAND: STALEXPORT AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>STALEXPORT AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.62 vs   3.92</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.73 vs   4.92</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.22 vs   4.24</p>
<p> Sales		  158.12 vs 131.87</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    18.85 vs    36.64</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	32.35 vs    53.84</p>
<p> Operating profit    28.58 vs    23.76</p>
<p> Sales		1,049.95 vs 1,279.48</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish steel trader is Stalexport SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
